  - On redirection (`GET /{code}`): atomically increments `ShortLink.ClickCount`, updates `ShortLink.LastVisitedAtUtc`, and atomically creates or increments `ShortLinkDailyClick` for `DateOnly.FromDateTime(DateTime.UtcNow)`.
  - On daily analytics query (`GET /analytics/{code}/daily`): fetches daily counts for `ShortLinkId` within the window `[TodayUtc - days + 1, TodayUtc]`, projects them into memory, and zero-fills any inactive dates into a contiguous ascending sequence.

